 normal; min-height: 20.3px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">夜に、今日</span><span class=\"s2\">1</span><span class=\"s1\">日頑張ったなと疲れを癒すために</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">朝に、これから最高の自分で頑張るために</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s1\">是非一緒にリポりましょう！</span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"p2\" style=\"margin: 0px; font-stretch: normal; line-height: normal; min-height: 20.3px; caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; -webkit-text-size-adjust: auto;\"><span class=\"s2\"